{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想為每次訓練留下清晰紀錄，又不想被複雜功能淹沒？《Training After 50》專為希望簡單記錄運動與追蹤進度的成年人而設，讓你集中整理訓練資料。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，適合剛開始重訓或想有系統地回顧表現的使用者。</p>\n\n<h2>記錄動作重量次數與備註</h2>\n<p>應用程式讓使用者記錄動作、重量、組數、次數與備註，並內置動作指南，方便隨時翻查。你可以重溫訓練歷史，比較不同時段的表現，更可利用完整應用備份匯出及還原紀錄，避免資料遺失。所有訓練、補充品紀錄、飲食日誌與照片均儲存在裝置本地，標籤文字亦在裝置上讀取。原價 US $0.99，現時限時免費，正是開始建立個人訓練檔案的好時機。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-387-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-388-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-389-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-390-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-391-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-392-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：: Training After 50</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-26T11:18:40.312241+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":352,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}